Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Потому
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reread
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not only true Tammy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woodhead, Misuden, Kumon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yemen, Royal Moon is not there\Nfor you, they are not quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how about nothing? Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing but nothing I\Ndon't know. I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget. I'm not just\Na stage. I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never wait. I'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally found Mimi living\Nlike a princess in a castle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a bunch of froggy-looking\Nguys called Gekomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had the idea that\NMimi singing could wake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up their lord and master\Nfrom a kind of coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mimi loved the royal treatment,\Nso she just strung them along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made up lots of excuses why\Nshe couldn't get through her song,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when we told her to stop fooling\Naround, she went and threw us in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She finally came to her\Nsenses and sang her song.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big guy woke up, but in a nasty mood.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.64,0:02:15.11,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Radiant Wings! Garudamon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of Demi-Devi-mon's\Ntricks, we all became separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we caught wind of that blowhard,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were able to find each\Nother, except for Zora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired Come on, Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get off your throne I wouldn't\Nexactly call this a throne Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, I wouldn't call you a princess
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, over here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Matt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've seen you, My.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've shrunk. Don't\Nrub it in. Where's Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought you might\Nknow, we haven't seen her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's weird it's not like\Nher to disappear like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:03:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well actually i think i saw\Nsora huh so where did you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see her at the gegamon's\Ncastle but i might have been
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dreaming that a girl i knew\Nyou'd come back to yourself i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think you're right it must\Nhave been a dream actually
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i forgot that when i was just\Nabout to eat one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mushrooms of forgetfulness\Nwhen i was agumon I heard a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A voice that sounded a lot\Nlike Sora's. That's real weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Sora is actually close to where we\Nare Why doesn't she come out and tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe Sora just doesn't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse, maybe she just can't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is we've got to find her quick
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like we're\Nplaying tag with her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, the signal point's this way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of your stupidity,\Nall of my evil plans
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have failed oh boy my\NMyotismon how'd i ever
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Vamdemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Undead Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Night Raid
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:13.69,Sign,,360,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bloody Stream
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get stuck working for\Nthis guy talk about a bad
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,temper and he's got all\Nthose bats i hate bats
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give my mistakes, Master,\Nmy oldest man, I beg you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage. Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship The children's\Ncrests are beginning to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glow One by one Everyone\Nmakes mistakes Remember Disco?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, sir, not all the children's\Ncrests have begun to glow yet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl has the crest of love And\Nit's still not glowing, thanks to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, according to my schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll be meeting up with\Nthe other children very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when she does master my\NMyotismon, when they are all together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's when I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:05:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fail me again, my bats\Nwill have a new chew toy. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate bats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, why don't we find a\Nspot to rest for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, for the\Nnext couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feet are killing me, not to\Nmention every other part of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go another inch. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a reading on my digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that fuzzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flymon's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brown stickers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this Digimon analyzer that\NGennai gave me could help us out.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.91,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}{\fad(400,0)}Flymon{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he is, Flymon.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.91,Sign,,220,0,160,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.07,0:05:50.91,Sign,,220,0,205,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.20,0:05:50.91,Sign,,220,0,230,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.32,0:05:50.91,Sign,,220,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.45,0:05:50.91,Sign,,220,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Deadly Sting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Classified as an insect\NDigimon, a virus type.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think we already\Nknow what his attack is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Flymon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,220,0,160,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,220,0,205,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,220,0,230,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,220,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,220,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Deadly Sting
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.87,0:05:59.29,Sign,,0,20,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sprays stingers\Nfilled with\Ndeadly poison
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not very pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here he comes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not working,\Nthey need more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marching Fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Pergermont's here, then so is Sora! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Tom! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,K .K., wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why were you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough running, tell us what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, does this mean that\Nyou don't like us anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, why don't you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened the night that Biyomon\Nand I left camp to try and find Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shh someone's here huh oh i saw a strange
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon he looked like a\Nbowling ball with wings
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he was talking to something in a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bubble so could you hear\Nwhat he was saying yeah i
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heard him talking about\Nour crests what about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them he was saying that\Neach of our crests has
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its own special meaning\Nfor example Tai yours
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the crest of courage\Nthe crest of courage oh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather your courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the crest started to glow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the crest you have, Matt,\Nis the crest of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship? And mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours is special, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the crest of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can get back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy's crest is the crest of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's is the crest of reliability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being there, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Mimi's is the crest of sincerity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, mine is\Nthe Crest of Love. Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:09:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the crest of love, that's just\Nperfect for you, Sora No, it's not,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're wrong Don't even say that, Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not like me at all\NBut Sora, it is like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're always thinking\Nof everyone else No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to\Neveryone else The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't know the first\Nthing about me So back off
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tai, Sora, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that my crest,\Nit won't glow. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I don't have any love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love us, don't you, Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that girls always have to\Nget so emotional when it comes to love?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon thought I was funny, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your name, by any chance, Demi-Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're one of those\Nkids that did you destined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear about the crests?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, in fact, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that kid, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you laughing about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just think you're so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able\Nto make the crest glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was something serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like they were going to stop making\Nthose stuffed beanbag animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Demidevimon is a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It started back when I was\Non a girls' soccer team
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family owned a flower shop. It\Nwas my mom's whole life. Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, I gotta go to the soccer match The\Ngirls are counting on me Don't talk so loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dear The flowers are very sensitive But\Nthis match is to win the title Sora,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't go with your knee\Ninjured like that But Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my leg's fine I'm sorry,\Nyou can't go Sit down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to talk I want\Nyou to stop playing soccer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and come to work at the flower\Nshop after school. Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop playing to work\Nwith smelly old flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe a daughter\Nof mine would act this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My decision is final.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I walked around for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found myself at the soccer field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game had just finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost the game 6-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My teammates were so depressed that they
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't even notice me\Nwhen they walked by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt like I had let them all\Ndown, like it was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom said I had to be part of\Nthe family business, no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like it's the only thing\Nthat's important to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I know he wasn't lying when he\Nsaid I grew up not knowing what love is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it. Even if what you\Nsaid is true, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe a word from that loser Demidevimon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a creep that's\Ntrying to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, don't cry, Sora
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, help me out I don't know what to\Ndo with her when she starts blubbering
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let her go, Tai. She'll be okay, Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's like a real grown-up How\Nif only he would cut his hair
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, I forgot to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told us not to eat\Nthe mushrooms, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for\Nsaving us. Right, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought Demidevimon was up to no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we kept out of sight and made\Nsure you guys stayed out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were even there when you guys\Nwere working in the restaurant, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hide from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all worried Sora just needed\Nto be allowed for a little while
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she really didn't want to be\NSeparated from you guys Please understand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you So please don't go away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again I don't like being away from you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're around I\Ndon't miss my mom as much
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so Oh, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what took you guys so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we would have been here\Nsooner, but Joe fell in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the one who was hungry and tired\Nand had to sit down every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, they're all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must tell my Otis Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound asleep. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otis Mod will be so proud of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demi Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wake up! Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, I will protect you. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demi-Demi-Mond!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your journey ends here. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing\NDemi-Devimon was talking to!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a thing, he's Lord Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maiorismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lord Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These Digidestined are making\Nme feel a little batty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grizzly Weed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivolve to Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try to get my plane across!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, he's just too strong for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one left\Nto fight my Otis Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please understand, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Viumon, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My decision is final.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora, why can't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought my mom was\Nthinking about her flower shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she was really worried\Nabout me getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth, the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Airdramon! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spurgeamon Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is that glow coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, I can feel your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's making me strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crest, it glows.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Garudamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,360,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,360,0,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,360,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bird Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,360,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.86,0:19:08.83,Sign,,360,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Shadow Wing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garudamon is the ultimate\Nform of Birdramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She commands the sky\Nand protects the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her attack is a flaming\Nbird called Wingblade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, why is it now the Crest of Love glows,\Njust as I was about to claim victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wingblade!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not anticipate such strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone. Climb on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you won't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you had to do was\Nstop worrying about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora And you got your crest to\Nwork When Biyomon was in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of getting hurt I realized that\NI was acting just like my mom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what I realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom loved me all along
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was your love that\Nhelped me ditch evolve, Sora
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you are capable of\Nlove after all I felt something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.30,0:20:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it was your love shining\Nthrough I felt something, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made me feel uncomfortable Love shouldn't\Nmake you feel like that That's right, TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why you felt\Nuncomfortable, Joe Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These were in your pocket
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess it wasn't love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora joined up with us again,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were closer than ever We finally\Nthought things were going our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You foolish Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seven of you are\Nno match for my powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for your ultimate destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to do with all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jacket with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:21:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun will shine in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.15,0:23:05.06,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Vamdemon's Castle of Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.76,0:23:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

